{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An old friend returns in The Sins of New Wells in which a new district means business as usual\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333870/extras/NEW1City_consumed_sin.png?t=1741111127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sinners, drugs, murder and journalists run rampant in the city of New Wells. Homicide detective Roy Samson has been transferred to the 9th District to unravel the corrupt underground network of the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333870/extras/Rise_DLC_1_GIF_1.gif?t=1741111127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Four New Scenarios to Investigate</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Roy Samson and his new partner, Cliff Savea, on the case to solve four brand new scenarios dealing with an organized crime syndicate plaguing the big smoke of New Wells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Deadly Pursuit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But, things aren\u2019t as they seem, something unprecedented is happening. Lemurian magic is making headlines again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333870/extras/Rise_DLC_1_GIF_2.gif?t=1741111127\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Investigate Characters Old and New</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your sleuthing skills to interrogate evasive witnesses, piece together murderous puzzles and read between the lines to uncover the truth.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3333870?t=1741111127","background_raw